query success
conversion
time to success
reformulation rate
etc.

This is an online experiment.

42. Why A/B testing is powerful

Offline:

documents + judgments

Online:

real users
real queries
real behavior

So online testing captures things offline judgments may miss.

But it is expensive and can be noisy.

