# 60. Complexity Cheat Sheet

| Algorithm             | Main purpose                    | Typical complexity                                     |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| Hamming               | Fixed-length comparison         | (O(n))                                                 |
| Levenshtein           | Edit distance                   | (O(mn))                                                |
| Damerau-Levenshtein   | Edit + transposition            | (O(mn)) for common DP variants                         |
| Needleman-Wunsch      | Global alignment                | (O(mn))                                                |
| Smith-Waterman        | Local alignment                 | (O(mn))                                                |
| Jaro                  | String similarity               | roughly (O(m+n)) for bounded matching work             |
| Jaro-Winkler          | Jaro + prefix                   | roughly same order                                     |
