       ├─ Hamming                    ├─ FST intersection
       ├─ Jaro                       ├─ BK-tree
       └─ Jaro-Winkler               └─ SymSpell
       │
       ▼
    Alignment
       │
       ├─ Needleman-Wunsch → global
       └─ Smith-Waterman   → local
                      │
                      ▼
                Spell Correction
                      │
                 ┌────┴────┐
                 │         │
              Norvig   Noisy Channel
```

The **most important progression to understand deeply** is:

**Levenshtein DP → banded/Ukkonen → Levenshtein automata → FST intersection → Lucene fuzzy search.**

That progression explains how you go from **"compare two strings in (O(mn))"** to **"search millions of dictionary terms approximately without running full DP against every term."**
